ADDITIONAL NOTICE -- AUTOMATED TRADING RISK

This software connects to a live or demo trading account and can open, close,
and modify real financial positions without further human confirmation. It is
provided for educational and self-hosting purposes only, is not financial
advice, and comes with no guarantee of correctness, uptime, or profitability.
You are solely responsible for any trading losses, for your broker's terms of
service, for any Windows and MetaTrader licensing obligations, and for
securing your own deployment (webhook secrets, network exposure, credentials).
Test thoroughly on a demo account before connecting this to a live one.
